  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The proposed single-storey rear extension by reason of its size, scale and proportion, would create an obtrusive feature harmful to the architecture and design of the original house. It is also considered by reason of its size, in such close proximity to the adjacent property, that it would have an obtrusive over bearing impact, which would harm the living conditions of neighbours through poor outlook and overshadowing. The proposed development is therefore not consistent with policies ENV-B.1.1 (All New Development) and H.6.4 (Alterations and Extensions) of the adopted Unitary Development Plan and the Residential Extension Guidelines."
